lots match the bulletin's own open-range phrasing. SEMESTER-ORDER FIX (2026-09-18 review pass): AFAM 152/HIST 152 and AFAM 110N (plus the GEN ED GQ tag) were swapped between Semester 1 and 2 relative to the real bulletin -- confirmed via a fresh scraper/archive re-parse that AFAM 152/HIST 152 belongs in Fall (Semester 1) and AFAM 110N + the Quantification Gen Ed belongs in Spring (Semester 2). Corrected; re-verified 0 warnings.",
